### {{ sec_num }}.1 Applied Net Rock, Net Reservoir & Net Pay Cut-offs

* **Shale Volume Cut-off ($V_{sh,cutoff}$):** $\le {{ "%.2f"|format(cutoffs.vsh) }}\text{ v/v}$ (Defines **Net Rock** flag)
* **Effective Porosity Cut-off ($\phi_{e,cutoff}$):** $\ge {{ "%.2f"|format(cutoffs.phie) }}\text{ v/v}$ (Defines **Net Reservoir** flag where $V_{sh} \le V_{sh,cutoff}$)
* **Water Saturation Cut-off ($S_{w,cutoff}$):** $\le {{ "%.2f"|format(cutoffs.sw) }}\text{ v/v}$ (Defines **Net Pay** flag where Net Reservoir $= 1$)

$$\text{NTG} = \frac{\sum h_{net}}{\sum h_{gross}}, \quad \bar{\phi}_e = \frac{\sum h_i \cdot \phi_{e,i}}{\sum h_i}, \quad \bar{S}_w = \frac{\sum h_i \cdot \phi_{e,i} \cdot S_{w,i}}{\sum h_i \cdot \phi_{e,i}}, \quad HCPT = \sum h_i \cdot \phi_{e,i} \cdot (1 - S_{w,i})$$

